               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">FQD3P50 - MOSFET - P-Channel, QFET</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">This Pâˆ’Channel enhancement mode power MOSFET is produced using ON Semiconductorâ€™s proprietary planar stripe and DMOS technology. This advanced MOSFET technology has been especially tailored to reduce onâˆ’state resistance, and to provide superior switching performance and high avalanche energy strength. These devices are suitable for switched mode power supplies, active power factor correction (PFC), and electronic lamp ballasts.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
